  "releaseNotes": "This release introduces the first stable version of the Non-Relational DB Provider for .NET, designed to simplify and standardize interaction with Non-Relational (NoSQL) databases\nUnified API for Create, Read, Update, and Delete (CRUD) operations\nVersion 0.0.1:\n- Centralized session and connection management\n- Standardized response models with correlation IDs for traceability\n- Built-in input validation and parameter checking\n- Provider-based design enabling easy extension",
